    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093840/extras/4a83074a0a74c2540c331e36eac9af16.avif?t=1755450632\" width=500 height=100 /></span><br><br>Explore the dark marine abysses in <strong>AquaDream</strong>, a captivating puzzle game. Take on the role of a brave anglerfish and solve complex puzzles in the heart of underwater labyrinths. Find hidden keys, activate towers to open new passages, and follow ocean currents precisely to avoid deadly traps.<br><br>But that's not all! Collect a variety of rare shells scattered throughout the levels to complete your personal collection. Each shell collected brings you one step closer to becoming the master of the depths.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093840/extras/c0fcc183af28afb89b496c670aca451d.avif?t=1755450632\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Challenging puzzles in an immersive marine environment <br></li><li> Labyrinths to explore and secret passages to discover <br></li><li> Keys and towers to activate for progress <br></li><li> Traps to avoid and ocean currents to follow <br></li><li> A collection of rare shells to complete</li></ul><br>Are you ready to take on the challenge and uncover the hidden secrets of the marine depths?",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093840/extras/4a83074a0a74c2540c331e36eac9af16.avif?t=1755450632\" width=500 height=100 /></span><br><br>Explore the dark marine abysses in <strong>AquaDream</strong>, a captivating puzzle game. Take on the role of a brave anglerfish and solve complex puzzles in the heart of underwater labyrinths. Find hidden keys, activate towers to open new passages, and follow ocean currents precisely to avoid deadly traps.<br><br>But that's not all! Collect a variety of rare shells scattered throughout the levels to complete your personal collection. Each shell collected brings you one step closer to becoming the master of the depths.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093840/extras/c0fcc183af28afb89b496c670aca451d.avif?t=1755450632\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Challenging puzzles in an immersive marine environment <br></li><li> Labyrinths to explore and secret passages to discover <br></li><li> Keys and towers to activate for progress <br></li><li> Traps to avoid and ocean currents to follow <br></li><li> A collection of rare shells to complete</li></ul><br>Are you ready to take on the challenge and uncover the hidden secrets of the marine depths?",
    "short_description": "Dive into AquaDream! Guide your anglerfish through intricate underwater mazes. Collect stars, solve puzzles, and avoid perilous obstacles. Experience a captivating deep-sea adventure filled with hidden treasures and mysteries in this immersive aquatic world.",
